"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtaining \"A Familiar Place\", part of the Key puzzle</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-Release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Familiar Island</b> (<i>Unofficial name</i>) was a tiny mass of land located west of the <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a>. <u><b>Any</b></u> ores and trees that spawned on <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> could be found at Familliar Island as well. The main landmark of this island was a small washed-up cabin, straight up from the older Typical Developers' title - Woodmill Inc. Touching it will yield a badge called \"A Familiar Place\".\n</p><p>To reach this island, one must locate a hatch on the shore behind the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a> and traverse a long tunnel under the ocean.\n</p><p>This island is no longer in the game after the map destruction event, if you are looking to achieve the \"A Familiar Place\" badge, please go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Shack\" title=\"Secret Shack\">Secret Shack</a> entry.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Island mostly consists of a small grass hill and beach all around it. The only noteworthy things here are: a trapdoor acting as the entrance to said island, one of the three <a href=\"/wiki/Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Key\">Key</a> pedestals and a washed-up cabin.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"382f167237ea1260589d212ed60edadb\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:172px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Trapdoor_Entrance-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:89px; width:185px; top:40.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Trapdoor_Entrance.png\" title=\"Trapdoor Entrance.png (760 KB)\" style=\"height:89px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/97/Trapdoor_Entrance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230719161528\" title=\"Trapdoor Entrance.png (760 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Entrance\" height=\"170\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Trapdoor Entrance.png\" data-image-key=\"Trapdoor_Entrance.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-ca